      "writtenOn": "2021-09-12T23:56:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When there\u0027s a reference is held by another, this service is not killed.\n\nSince debug_hold_vm holds a self-reference, this call seems to be needed. \n\nSteven might be able to provide a correct answer.",
